<title>CYPRUS: Repo yield on Cyprus auction drops to 4.41 pct.</title>
<headline>Repo yield on Cyprus auction drops to 4.41 pct.</headline>
<dateline>NICOSIA 1997-05-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>The average yield on a repo auction held between the Cyprus central bank and commercial banks was 4.41 percent on Wednesday, from 4.58 at the last auction held on May 19, the central bank said.</p>
<p>Yields for the 22.5 million pounds ($44.2 million) of bills sold ranged from 4.12 percent to to 4.79 percent. Bids totalled 26.1 million pounds.</p>
<p>-- Nicosia newsroom 357 2 365089</p>
<p>($1=0.506 pounds)</p>
